schema: public-use-boundary
object:
  tier: public-with-caveat
  consent_note: >-
    Article src/content/docs/tax-implications.md provides US-specific
    cryptocurrency tax guidance (capital gains treatment, taxable events,
    NFT/DeFi tax tables, IRS forms). It carries the source's own disclaimer:
    "Educational purposes only. Not tax advice. Consult a qualified
    professional for your specific situation." Flag for domain review before
    any public reuse, especially outside a US tax context, and note the
    article's own acknowledgment that the NFT "collectibles" tax treatment
    is debated/unsettled.
  review_type: domain-review (tax/legal accuracy + jurisdiction scope)
